  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Botswana Council for Non Governmental Organisation - BOCONGO : Project Empowering Voices</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Botswana Council for Non Governmental Organisation - BOCONGO Project Empowering Voices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to address the gaps by providing legal education , training stakeholders , facilitating survivor access to legal remedies and conducting gender sensitive community outreach.  This project is a collaboration between BOCONGO and Bonela to strengthen access to justice, enhancing legal and Human rights literacy and reinforcing the capacity of both state and non- state actors to deliver coordinated, right based and survivor centered response to gender based violence. It is also aligned to the Botswana s National Gender Based strategy 2022-2030</narrative>
